-border-top-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;\r\n  mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-right-alt:solid black .5pt;\r\n  background:#D9D9D9;padding:0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt;height:15.5pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">TOTAL<o:p></o:p></span></strong></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"93\" nowrap=\"\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"width:70.1pt;border-top:none;\r\n  border-left:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-right-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;\r\n  background:#D9D9D9;padding:0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt;height:15.5pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"right\" style=\"text-align:right\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">R$ 540,00<o:p></o:p></span></strong></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.3pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:11.1pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0pt;mso-line-height-alt:0pt;tab-stops:\r\n29.0pt\"><strong>1.2.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\r\n\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:=\"\" arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n9.5pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt\">A <strong>CONTRATADA</strong>\r\nprestará os serviços de manutenção nos equipamentos da <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong> da seguinte forma:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0pt;mso-line-height-alt:0pt;tab-stops:\r\n29.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:44.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-14.45pt;line-height:97%;\r\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:44.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><strong>i)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong>Manutenção\r\nPreventiva: </strong>Realizada mensalmente, agendada ou solicitada pela<strong> CONTRATANTE, </strong>contemplando<strong> </strong>limpeza, lubrificação, regulagens,\r\najustes internos e externos dos equipamentos.<strong><o:p></o:p></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:18.2pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:44.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-14.45pt;\r\nline-height:108%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:44.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><strong>ii)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong>Manutenção\r\nCorretiva</strong>: Acionada para correção de eventuais defeitos dos equipamentos, contemplando<strong> </strong>a troca ou substituição dos motores,\r\nacionando o<strong> </strong>Departamento Operacional\r\natravés de chamado técnico solicitado através de telefone (85) 988875713 <em>ou e-mail </em><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 108%; color: rgb(46, 116, 181); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">stel@stesistemas.com</span> ou <strong>grupo de ZAP</strong> criado especificamente para o acompanhamento dos\r\nserviços, para fins de controle, o atendimento para a manutenção corretiva<em> </em>seguirá o fluxo abaixo:<strong><o:p></o:p></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:58.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-14.15pt;\r\nline-height:107%;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo1;tab-stops:58.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Esporádico:\r\n</strong>O atendimento deverá ser realizado no prazo máximo de 12 (doze) horas úteis\r\ndo chamado e a<strong> CONTRATANTE </strong>tem\r\ndireito a chamados ilimitados mensais dessa natureza, dentro do horário\r\ncomercial<strong> </strong>entre 8:00 às 17:00 horas,\r\nde segunda a sexta-feira, e 8:00 às 12:00 horas aos sábados, exceto domingos e\r\nferiados.<span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:58.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-14.15pt;\r\nline-height:107%;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo1;tab-stops:58.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Emergencial:\r\n</strong>O atendimento fora do horário convencional será realizado de acordo com a\r\ndisponibilidade<strong> </strong>de horário da <strong>CONTRATADA</strong> e da necessidade emergencial\r\nda <strong>CONTRATANTE.</strong> Esses atendimentos\r\nterão valor adicional de <strong>R$ 100,00 (cem\r\nreais)</strong> ao valor mensal do contrato, sendo cobrados como excedentes, desde\r\nque previamente acordado pela <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong>.<span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:29.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.25pt;line-height:105%;tab-stops:28.0pt\"><a name=\"page2\"></a><strong>1.3.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>A <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong> obriga-se a colocar a total disposição da <strong>CONTRATADA</strong> os equipamentos durante o\r\ntempo necessário para a execução das manutenções preventiva e/ou corretivas, em\r\nhorário estabelecido entre 8:00 às 17:00 horas, de segunda a sexta-feira e aos\r\nsábados de 8:00 às 12:00 horas, com exceção dos domingos e feriados.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.75pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:29.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.25pt;line-height:97%;tab-stops:28.0pt\"><strong>1.4.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>A <strong>CONTRATADA</strong> se reserva no direito de\r\nrealizar qualquer manutenção fora do horário comercial do mesmo, ou quando lhe\r\nachar necessário, desde que autorizado e confirmado entre ambas as partes.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:18.2pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:29.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.25pt;line-height:105%;tab-stops:28.0pt\"><strong>1.5.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Fica\r\nestabelecido neste instrumento que, não sendo possível a manutenção corretiva\r\nno local da instalação do equipamento, o mesmo deverá ser recolhido para\r\nlaboratório da <strong>CONTRATADA</strong> afim de\r\nsanar o defeito apresentado, bem como os demais que eventualmente forem\r\ndetectados.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.65pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:29.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.25pt;line-height:97%;tab-stops:28.0pt\"><strong>1.6.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>A\r\ndocumentação e a procedência dos equipamentos (quando os mesmos não forem\r\nfornecidos pela <strong>CONTRATADA</strong>) serão de\r\ninteira responsabilidade da <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong>.\r\nOs equipamentos que eventualmente forem encaminhados para o laboratório do <strong>CONTRATADO</strong>, deverão seguir com a\r\nrespectiva nota fiscal em conformidade com a legislação ou de uma ordem de\r\nentrada de serviço, tendo ambas as partes pleno conhecimento do procedimento e\r\nestando em pleno acordo.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:18.2pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:29.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.25pt;line-height:108%;tab-stops:28.0pt\"><strong>1.7.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>A\r\nmanutenção preventiva e a manutenção corretiva, objetos do presente contrato\r\nserão feitas exclusivamente pela <strong>CONTRATADA</strong>,\r\ndevendo a <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong>, para esse\r\nfim, facultar livre acesso, sendo expressamente vedado à <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong>, em qualquer hipótese ou circunstância, realizar ou\r\npermitir a manutenção dos equipamentos por<strong>\r\n</strong>pessoas não autorizadas expressamente pela <strong>CONTRATADA</strong>.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.5pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:29.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.25pt;line-height:110%;tab-stops:28.0pt\"><strong>1.8.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Cada\r\nequipamento em que for realizada manutenção, seja preventiva ou corretiva, será\r\nacompanhado de uma etiqueta de identificação, a qual será usada para lacrar o\r\nequipamento. Se removida ou violada por pessoa estranha à <strong>CONTRATADA</strong>, a <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong>\r\nserá obrigada a prestar informações à <strong>CONTRATADA</strong>\r\nsobre o motivo da violação/remoção do lacre, correndo o risco caso detectada\r\nviolação indevida de pagar pela correção ou reposição do equipamento em questão\r\nsob a pena de rescisão contratual.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:29.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.25pt;line-height:110%;tab-stops:28.0pt\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:29.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.25pt;line-height:110%;tab-stops:28.0pt\"><strong>1.9.</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; A manutenção\r\npreventiva e a manutenção corretiva, objetos do presente contrato serão feitas\r\nexclusivamente pelo <strong>CONTRATADO</strong>,\r\ndevendo a <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong>, para esse\r\nfim, facultar livre acesso, sendo expressamente vetado a <strong>CONTRATANTE,</strong> em qualquer hipótese ou circunstância, realizar ou\r\npermitir a manutenção dos equipamentos por pessoas não autorizadas\r\nexpressamente e pelo <strong>CONTRATANTE.</strong><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:16.25pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:29.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.25pt;line-height:108%;tab-stops:28.0pt\"><strong>1.10.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp; </span>Exclui-se\r\ntotalmente deste contrato: <strong>serviços de\r\nreforma e pintura, serviço de tubulação e passagem de fios, construção de redes\r\nlógicas completas sem custo de mão-de-obra e materiais necessários, reparação\r\nde equipamento</strong> sem ônus quando comprovado mal uso ou dano provocado por\r\nações intencionais, ou não, por usuários, visitantes ou prestadores ou agentes\r\nnaturais como inundações, raios e outros.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:17.3pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:29.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.25pt;line-height:105%;tab-stops:28.0pt\"><strong>1.11.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp; </span>A\r\n<strong>CONTRATADA</strong> prestará os serviços\r\nconstantes nesta cláusula sem qualquer tipo de exclusividade, desempenhando\r\natividade para terceiros em geral, desde que não haja conflito de interesses\r\ncom o pactuado no presente Contrato, bem como com total responsabilidade e independência\r\ntécnico-operacional.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:17.55pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:29.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.25pt;line-height:105%;tab-stops:28.0pt\"><strong>1.12.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp; </span>A\r\n<strong>CONTRATADA</strong> declara, neste ato, que é\r\nportador de todas as documentações exigidas para a atividade prevista em seu\r\nobjeto social, estando sua atividade revestida de total regularidade perante o\r\nPoder Público, sindicatos da categoria, enfim, quaisquer agentes, órgãos e/ou\r\nautoridades públicas, de controle e fiscalização referida.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.25pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><u><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><u><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><u>CLÁUSULA SEGUNDA – DA VIGÊNCIA<o:p></o:p></u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:=\"\" arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:29.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.25pt;line-height:105%;tab-stops:28.0pt\"><strong>2.1.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><a name=\"page3\"></a>Sem data prevista para o\r\nvencimento/término do presente instrumento, O presente instrumento\r\npoderá ser rescindido a qualquer tempo, devendo, porém, a outra parte ser\r\navisada com 30 (trinta) dias de antecedência.<strong><o:p></o:p></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:29.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.25pt;line-height:105%;tab-stops:28.0pt\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:29.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.25pt;line-height:105%;tab-stops:28.0pt\"><strong>2.2.&nbsp;&nbsp; </strong>Após o término dos 12\r\nmeses iniciais deste, a cada 12(doze) meses serão revistos pelo LOCADOR valores\r\nde mensalidade e limites de atendimento, e será comunicado a <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong> com 30 dias de Antecedência\r\ncaso haja alguma alteração.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:17.95pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><u>CLÁUSULA TERCEIRA – DO PREÇO E FORMA DE PAGAMENTO<o:p></o:p></u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:18.15pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:29.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.25pt;line-height:105%;tab-stops:28.0pt\"><strong>3.1.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Em\r\ndecorrência da execução da locação e serviços, objeto do presente contrato, a <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong> pagará à <strong>CONTRATADA, </strong>no atendimento em horário\r\nnormal, o valor de <strong>R$ 540,00,</strong> valor\r\neste expresso em moeda nacional atual, podendo ser substituída por outra moeda,\r\ndevidamente convertida por ocasião de determinação da lei federal. <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:29.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.25pt;line-height:105%;tab-stops:28.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:57.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.25pt;line-height:105%\"><strong>3.1.1. </strong>Para\r\nexecução de serviços de<strong> manutenção\r\nemergencial, </strong>a<strong> CONTRATANTE </strong>pagará\r\nà<strong> CONTRATADA </strong>a<strong> </strong>importância de <strong>R$ 100,00\r\n(cem reais)</strong> a cada chamado atendido, devendo ser pago no mês subsequente,\r\njuntamente com a manutenção mensal.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:17.55pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:29.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.25pt;line-height:105%;tab-stops:28.0pt\"><strong>3.2.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>A\r\n<strong>CONTRATADA</strong> deverá emitir nota fiscal\r\nreferente a locação e a prestação de serviços, com antecedência mínima de 10\r\n(dez) dias da data do vencimento, e receberá o seu pagamento, através do\r\nsistema bancário ou em carteira, todo o 10°(decimo) dia de cada mês, a cobrança\r\ndeste contrato será efetuada mensalmente com o faturamento de uma nota de\r\nserviço juntamente com boleto bancário, na qual será especificada a referência\r\nao Contrato em questão e entregue juntamente na manutenção mensal.<span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:17.55pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:29.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.25pt;line-height:105%;tab-stops:28.0pt\"><strong>3.3.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Os\r\nvalores constantes deste Contrato serão reajustados após 12 (doze) meses de\r\nvigência, com base na variação do salário-mínimo determinado pelo Governo\r\nFederal no ano corrente.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:17.55pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:29.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.25pt;line-height:97%;tab-stops:28.0pt\"><strong>3.4.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Ocorrendo\r\no atraso no pagamento, sobre o débito da <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong>\r\nincidirá multa de 2% (dois por cento), com acréscimo de juros de mora de 1% (um\r\npor cento) ao mês, e correção monetária pelo índice IGP-M.<span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.4pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:29.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.25pt;line-height:111%;tab-stops:28.0pt\"><strong>3.5.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Nos\r\npreços ora acordados, são considerados incluídos todos os custos e tributos\r\ndireta ou indiretamente relacionados aos serviços a serem fornecidos, tais como\r\nsalários e encargos trabalhistas, contribuições previdenciárias, impostos,\r\ntaxas, emolumentos, contribuições fiscais e para fiscais, e quaisquer outros,\r\nserão da exclusiva responsabilidade da <strong>CONTRATADA</strong>,\r\nficando definido que em caso de mudança no Sistema Tributário Nacional que\r\nacarrete majoração de tributos incidentes na operação não haverá revisão contratual,\r\nconsiderando que as partes já contemplaram no valor do contrato eventuais\r\noscilações neste sentido.<span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><u><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><u>CLÁUSULA QUARTA – DAS OBRIGAÇÕES DA CONTRATADA<o:p></o:p></u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><u><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:12.25pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>4.1.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt\">São obrigações da <strong>CONTRATADA</strong>, além das já estabelecidas e constantes na legislação em\r\nvigor:</span><a name=\"page4\"></a><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:10.25pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:57.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.45pt;line-height:15.75pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;\r\ntab-stops:57.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">I.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->Efetuar manutenção preventiva nos equipamentos\r\nda <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong> de forma presencial,\r\numa vez por mês, procedendo à limpeza interna, ajustes e regulagens, e indicar\r\nos subconjuntos que apresentem sinais de desgaste.<span style=\"font-family:\r\n\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:=\"\" arial\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:57.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n15.75pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;tab-stops:57.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\r\n\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:=\"\" arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:57.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.45pt;line-height:108%;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:57.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><strong>III.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></strong><!--[endif]-->Efetuar manutenção <strong>Esporádico</strong> , <u>sem custo adicional</u>, sempre que solicitado pela\r\n<strong>CONTRATANTE</strong>, dentro do horário das\r\n8:00 às 17:00 horas, de segunda a sexta-feira, exceto feriados, doravante\r\ndenominado <strong><o:p></o:p></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:57.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n108%;tab-stops:57.0pt\">horário normal, com um prazo máximo de atendimento de 12\r\n(doze) horas contados a partir do chamado (chegada do técnico no local),\r\ncontados dentro do horário normal.<strong><o:p></o:p></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:17.3pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:57.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-27.95pt;line-height:110%;tab-stops:56.0pt\"><strong>IV.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Obedecer\r\nfielmente todas as disposições deste Contrato, especialmente aos prazos de\r\nexecução e entrega dos serviços, utilizando mão de obra especializada, com\r\nobservância dos padrões e normas técnicas aplicáveis a serviço desta natureza,\r\nassumindo todos os ônus relativos aos serviços prestados, inclusive pelos danos\r\nprovocados por execução inadequada dos mesmos, sem direito a pagamento\r\nadicional ou a prorrogação do prazo, independentemente das penalidades\r\ncabíveis.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:17.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:57.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.45pt;line-height:15.75pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;\r\ntab-stops:57.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">V.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->Manter o mais absoluto sigilo e\r\nconfidencialidade sobre os serviços, documentos, pesquisas, e demais\r\ninformações apuradas em qualquer uma das etapas de trabalho, comprometendo-se\r\nainda a não divulgar para terceiros as informações obtidas.<span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:16.4pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:57.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-27.95pt;line-height:112%;tab-stops:56.0pt\"><strong>VI.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Responsabilizar-se,\r\ncomo única empregadora que é, pelo cumprimento pontual de todas as obrigações\r\nrelativas ao seu pessoal, ainda que não expressas neste instrumento, mas\r\nlegalmente exigíveis à <strong>CONTRATADA</strong>,\r\ninclusive, mas não apenas, com seguro por acidente de trabalho, pagamento de\r\ntodos os<strong> </strong>salários e encargos\r\ntrabalhistas, sociais, previdenciários, fiscais e pelo pagamento ou\r\nressarcimento à <strong>CONTRATANTE </strong>de\r\nvalores resultantes de decisões judiciais em favor de trabalhador seu ou de\r\nvalores<strong> </strong>relativos à multa ou\r\nqualquer outra quantia relativa a infração de natureza trabalhista, social,\r\nprevidenciária ou fiscal, referente a períodos de apuração compreendidos na\r\nvigência do presente contrato, bem como se obriga ainda a excluir a <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong> de qualquer demanda\r\najuizada contra a <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong> em\r\ndecorrência de tais obrigações, bem como ressarci-la de quaisquer despesas a\r\nque tenha sido condenada em virtude de tais demandas, facultada à <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong> a retenção de eventuais\r\nvalores pendentes para cobrir tais despesas, até satisfação total do débito.<span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:14.9pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:57.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-27.95pt;line-height:108%;tab-stops:56.0pt\"><strong>VII.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Responsabilizar-se\r\npela atuação e bom comportamento do pessoal contratado durante a prestação dos\r\nserviços a seu cargo e nas dependências da <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong>,\r\nobrigando-se a retirar do local todo ou qualquer empregado, preposto ou\r\ncontratado, cuja presença seja considerada inconveniente pela <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong>, responsabilizando-se,\r\nainda, por eventuais prejuízos causados por seus empregados,<a name=\"page5\"></a> prepostos\r\nou pessoas que se encontrem sob seu comando, inclusive eventuais prestadores de\r\nserviço, sem configurar qualquer vínculo de subordinação com a <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong>.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:16.4pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:57.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.45pt;line-height:108%;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:57.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><strong>X.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></strong><!--[endif]-->Manter a <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong> indene de quaisquer responsabilidades por quaisquer\r\neventos decorrentes dos serviços ora contratados, respondendo, inclusive, por\r\nhonorários advocatícios de profissional a ser indicado pela própria <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong>, a seu exclusivo critério,\r\ncustas e emolumentos e/ou quaisquer outros desembolsos que se façam\r\nnecessários.<strong><o:p></o:p></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.4pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:57.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-27.95pt;line-height:105%;tab-stops:56.0pt\"><strong>IX.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Responder\r\npor danos de qualquer natureza, causados por seu pessoal, devendo ressarci-los\r\nà <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong>, mediante desconto no\r\nvalor de pagamento devido à<strong> CONTRATADA </strong>ou\r\nexigência do<strong> </strong>depósito do valor\r\ncorrespondente, a critério da <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong>.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.75pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:57.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-27.95pt;line-height:97%;tab-stops:56.0pt\"><strong>X.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Cooperar\r\ncom o corpo de funcionários da <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong>\r\npara que não haja embaraços ou interrupção de funcionamento das atividades em\r\nandamento no local da prestação de serviços.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:16.4pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:57.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-27.95pt;line-height:108%;tab-stops:56.0pt\"><strong>XI.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Fornecer\r\nalimentação, fardamento e todos os EPI\'s (Equipamentos de Proteção Individual)\r\naos seus funcionários para realização dos serviços contratados, respeitando\r\ntodas as normas de segurança do trabalho, cobrando a utilização dos EPI´s pelos\r\nfuncionários, sendo única e exclusivamente responsável por qualquer fato\r\nadvindo do descumprimento desta cláusula.<strong><o:p></o:p></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:57.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-27.95pt;line-height:110%;tab-stops:56.0pt\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:57.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-27.95pt;line-height:110%;tab-stops:56.0pt\"><strong>XII.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Assumir\r\ne assegurar a responsabilidade total pelo fornecimento e guarda de todos seus\r\nequipamentos, materiais e próprio pessoal, necessários ao desenvolvimento dos\r\nserviços ora contratados, sendo de sua inteira e exclusiva responsabilidade\r\ntodo e qualquer acidente, dano ou outro prejuízo decorrente dessa atividade,\r\ndevendo arcar, ainda, com as despesas decorrentes de perda, roubo, furto ou\r\nextravio de suas ferramentas e/ou equipamentos.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.3pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:57.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-27.95pt;line-height:108%;tab-stops:56.0pt\"><strong>XIII.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Cumprir,\r\nem relação a si própria e a seu pessoal, a legislação, inclusive, mas não se\r\nlimitando a de natureza ambiental, segurança e higiene do trabalho, aplicável\r\nao exercício das atividades relacionadas aos serviços regulados por este\r\ninstrumento, além dos regulamentos internos, estabelecidos pela <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong>, observando todas as\r\nformalidades exigidas para o perfeito funcionamento da empresa.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:29.0pt;mso-line-height-alt:0pt;\r\ntab-stops:56.0pt\"><strong>XIV.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt\">Acompanhar e prestar\r\ninformações solicitadas sempre que solicitado pela <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:18.15pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:57.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-27.95pt;line-height:97%;tab-stops:56.0pt\"><strong>XV.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Colocar\r\nà disposição da <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong> todos os\r\ndocumentos e informações necessárias para a instrução deste Contrato.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:16.3pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:57.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-27.95pt;line-height:97%;tab-stops:56.0pt\"><strong>XVI.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Instruir\r\na <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong> quanto às\r\npropriedades, modo de utilização, normas operacionais e de segurança do objeto\r\ncontratual.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:57.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-27.95pt;line-height:97%;tab-stops:56.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:14.1pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><u>CLÁUSULA QUINTA – DAS OBRIGAÇÕES DA CONTRATANTE<o:p></o:p></u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.85pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>5.1.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt\">São obrigações da <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong>:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:16.35pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:57.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.45pt;line-height:10.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo6;\r\ntab-stops:57.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">I.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->Disponibilizar à <strong>CONTRATADA</strong> acesso ao local da prestação dos serviços e\r\nproporcionar-lhe, no que for de sua competência, todas as condições necessárias\r\nao bom andamento do serviço, devendo ocorrer de forma escrita a proibição de\r\nacesso.<a name=\"page6\"></a><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:10.25pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:57.0pt;text-indent:-28.45pt;line-height:\r\n97%;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo7;tab-stops:57.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><strong>II.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></strong><!--[endif]-->Pagar pontualmente as faturas emitidas pela <strong>CONTRATADA</strong>, nas condições estabelecidas\r\nna CLÁUSULA TERCEIRA.<strong><o:p></o:p></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:16.4pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:57.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.45pt;line-height:93%;mso-list:l7 level1 lfo8;tab-stops:57.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><strong>III.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></strong><!--[endif]-->Permitir acesso do técnico a uma linha\r\ntelefonia fixa da central do Estacionamento, para comunicação externa,\r\nexclusivamente com a <strong>CONTRATADA</strong> ou\r\npessoa técnica ligada a esta, para esclarecimento de eventuais dúvidas.<strong><o:p></o:p></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:14.65pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:57.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-27.95pt;line-height:97%;tab-stops:56.0pt\"><strong>IV.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Fazer\r\ntodas as solicitações de manutenção, via telefone e/ou <em>e-mail,</em> sendo que o horário oficial para contagem do início do\r\nchamado será sempre o horário da confirmação da solicitação por parte da<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:1.9pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:57.0pt;mso-line-height-alt:0pt\"><strong>CONTRATADA</strong>.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:18.15pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:57.0pt;text-indent:-28.45pt;line-height:\r\n97%;mso-list:l8 level1 lfo9;tab-stops:57.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><strong>V.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></strong><!--[endif]-->Relatar por escrito através de <em>e-mail</em> à <strong>CONTRATADA</strong>, toda e qualquer irregularidade ou comentários nos\r\nserviços prestados pela <strong>CONTRATADA</strong>.<strong><o:p></o:p></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:18.1pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:12.35pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:57.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-27.95pt;line-height:97%;tab-stops:56.0pt\"><strong>VIII.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Responsabilizar-se\r\npor acionar a <strong>CONTRATADA</strong> para a\r\nrealização de manutenções preventivas e ou corretivas do equipamento durante a\r\nvigência deste contrato.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:18.2pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:57.0pt;text-indent:-28.45pt;line-height:\r\n97%;mso-list:l9 level1 lfo10;tab-stops:57.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><strong>X.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></strong><!--[endif]-->Abster-se de estabelecer qualquer gravame ou\r\npenhora sobre o equipamento ou qualquer dos seus direitos previstos no presente\r\ncontrato.<strong><o:p></o:p></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.9pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><u><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><u>CLÁUSULA SEXTA – DOS NOVOS EQUIPAMENTOS<o:p></o:p></u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:18.05pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:29.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.25pt;line-height:105%;tab-stops:28.0pt\"><strong>6.1.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Os\r\nnovos equipamentos que vierem a ser adquiridos ou realizado <em>upgrades</em>, no período de abrangência\r\ndeste contrato, deverão ser requisitados pela <strong>CONTRATENTE</strong> e sendo os mesmos incluídos, no prazo de 15 (quinze)\r\ndias a partir da requisição, para o devido controle e reajuste de objeto, como\r\nAditivo<strong>.<o:p></o:p></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.25pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><u>CLÁUSULA SÉTIMA – DA MUDANÇA DE EQUIPAMENTO DO LOCAL<o:p></o:p></u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:18.15pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:29.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.25pt;line-height:105%;tab-stops:28.0pt\"><strong>7.1.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Toda\r\ne qualquer mudança de local dos equipamentos ou em partes, deve ser comunicada\r\nà <strong>CONTRATADA</strong>, com no mínimo 7 (sete)\r\ndias de antecedência, e se possível, ser efetuada com acompanhamento, ou mesmo\r\nser executada por um técnico da <strong>CONTRATADA</strong>.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.75pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:29.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.25pt;line-height:108%;tab-stops:28.0pt\"><strong>7.2.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Todas\r\nas despesas decorrentes da mudança serão de responsabilidade da CONTRATANTE,\r\ninclusive despesas de transporte, seguros, embalagens, mais taxas de serviços\r\nque serão cobradas conforme a tabela de preços vigentes na data da respectiva\r\nmudança, caso haja, no valor este acordado entre ambas as partes sob forma de\r\norçamento e será faturado como excedente ao valor mensal do contrato.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:13.2pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><u>CLÁUSULA OITAVA – DA RESCISÃO CONTRATUAL<o:p></o:p></u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:18.15pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:29.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.25pt;line-height:97%;tab-stops:28.0pt\"><strong>8.1.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>O\r\npresente instrumento poderá ser rescindido a qualquer tempo, devendo, porém, a\r\noutra parte ser avisada com 30 (noventa) dias de antecedência.<strong><o:p></o:p></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:29.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.25pt;line-height:105%;tab-stops:28.0pt\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:29.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.25pt;line-height:105%;tab-stops:28.0pt\"><strong>8.2.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Considerar-se-á\r\nrescindido o presente Contrato, independentemente de notificação ou\r\ninterpelação judicial, por inadimplemento de qualquer CLÁUSULA, item ou\r\ncondição nele estipulada, e, especificamente, nas seguintes hipóteses, sem\r\nprejuízo das demais já estabelecidas e constantes na legislação em vigor:<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:13.45pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:43.0pt;text-indent:-14.45pt;line-height:\r\n10.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;mso-list:l10 level1 lfo11;tab-stops:43.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">I.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->Insolvência, falência ou concordata de qualquer\r\numa das partes;<a name=\"page8\"></a><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:10.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:10.25pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:43.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-14.45pt;line-height:97%;mso-list:l11 level1 lfo12;tab-stops:43.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><strong>II.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></strong><!--[endif]-->Cessão ou transferência total ou parcial do\r\npresente Contrato a terceiros pela <strong>CONTRATADA</strong>,\r\nou a subcontratação de qualquer serviço a ele relativo, ou de parte dele, sem a\r\nprévia autorização por escrito da<strong><o:p></o:p></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:1.85pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:43.0pt;mso-line-height-alt:0pt\"><strong>CONTRATANTE;<o:p></o:p></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:12.65pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:43.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-14.45pt;line-height:105%;mso-list:l12 level1 lfo13;tab-stops:43.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><strong>III.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></strong><!--[endif]-->Descumprimento de quaisquer cláusulas ou\r\ncondições estipuladas no presente instrumento e na legislação correlata, e\r\ndesde que a causa do descumprimento não seja sanada no prazo de 7 (sete) dias\r\ncontados do recebimento de notificação expressa neste sentido.<strong><o:p></o:p></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.25pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:14.8pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><u>CLÁUSULA NONA – DAS DISPOSIÇÕES DIVERSAS<o:p></o:p></u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:18.15pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:29.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-28.25pt;line-height:111%;tab-stops:28.0pt\"><strong>9.1.</strong><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>O\r\npresente contrato tem como objeto o descrito na Cláusula Primeira, e em\r\nconsequência, somente poderão ser atribuídos às <strong>PARTES</strong>, os direitos e obrigações próprias de sua natureza jurídica,\r\ne aqueles específicos nele expressamente estabelecidos, não sendo permitido em\r\nnenhuma hipótese este instrumento ser invocado ou aplicado de maneira a\r\npermitir à <strong>CONTRATADA</strong>\r\nresponsabilizar a <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong> por\r\nobrigações que houver assumido ou que lhe devam ser atribuída, além daquelas\r\ndiretamente relacionadas com o seu objeto e com as suas condições e vice-versa.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:16.8pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:43.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-14.45pt;line-height:108%;mso-list:l13 level1 lfo14;tab-stops:43.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><strong>I.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></strong><!--[endif]-->A mera tolerância da parte <strong>CONTRATANTE</strong> ou omissão ao\r\ndescumprimento de qualquer das condições ora pactuadas não implicará renúncia\r\nou novação às obrigações assumidas, podendo o seu cumprimento vir a ser exigido\r\na qualquer tempo, ficando expressamente ajustado que as referidas condições\r\nsomente poderão ser eficazmente alteradas mediante formalização de aditivo.<a name=\"page9\"></a><strong><o:p></o:p></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:1.0pt;mso-line-height-alt:0pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n10.0pt;font-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:10.25pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:43.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-14.45pt;line-height:105%;mso-list:l14 level1 lfo15;tab-stops:43.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><strong>II.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></strong><!--[endif]-->O presente contrato, nas obrigações de\r\nqualquer natureza nele assumidas, tem força de título executivo extrajudicial,\r\nna forma do art. 784, III, do Código de Processo Civil, constitutivo que é de\r\nobrigações de fazer e de pagar, e lavrado e assinado segundo os requisitos\r\nlegais.<strong><o:p></o:p></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:17.55pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:43.0pt;text-indent:-14.45pt;line-height:\r\n97%;mso-list:l15 level1 lfo16;tab-stops:43.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><strong>III.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></strong><!--[endif]-->O presente Contrato é celebrado em caráter\r\nirrevogável e irretratável e obriga as <strong>PARTES</strong>\r\ne seus sucessores a qualquer título.<strong><o:p></o:p></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:18.2pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:43.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:\r\n-14.25pt;line-height:108%\"><strong>IV. </strong>Cada\r\ndisposição deste instrumento será considerada como sendo um acordo separado\r\nentre as<strong> PARTES </strong>de<strong> </strong>forma que, se quaisquer das\r\ndisposições aqui contidas forem judicialmente consideradas inválidas, ilegais\r\nou inexequíveis, a validade, legalidade e exequibilidade das disposições\r\nrestantes não serão de forma alguma afetadas ou prejudicadas.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.5pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:43.0pt;text-indent:-14.45pt;line-height:\r\n97%;mso-list:l16 level1 lfo17;tab-stops:43.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><strong>V.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></strong><!--[endif]-->Qualquer alteração ao presente contrato ou\r\nnovo serviço requerido de forma verbal somente terá validade para execução no\r\ncaso de existir previsão, inclusive quanto ao preço, mediante a assinatura de\r\ntermo aditivo.<strong><o:p></o:p></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.9pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><u>CLÁUSULA DÉCIMA &nbsp;– DO FORO<o:p></o:p></u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:18.05pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:97%\">Fica eleito o foro da Comarca de\r\nFortaleza/CE, o qual será competente para dirimir as questões decorrentes do\r\ncontrato ou sua execução, com renúncia expressa a qualquer outro, por mais\r\nprivilegiando que seja.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:18.2pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:97%\">E, por estarem justos e contratados,\r\nassinam este instrumento em 2 (duas) vias, de igual teor e forma, para o mesmo\r\nefeito, perante 2 (duas) testemunhas.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:97%\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:14.75pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:14.75pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:350.0pt;mso-line-height-alt:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\nFortaleza, 20 de Maio de 2024.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.85pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>CONTRATANTE<o:p></o:p></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:333.15pt;text-align:justify;mso-line-height-alt:\r\n0pt\">\r\n\r\n<strong><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\" calibri\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:=\"\" arial;mso-ansi-language:pt-br;mso-fareast-language:pt-br;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><br clear=\"all\" style=\"page-break-before:always;mso-break-type:section-break\">\r\n</span></strong>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:17.9pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt\">________________________________________<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:4.15pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">CONDOMINIO\r\nEDIFICIO PORT IDEAL</span></strong><strong><o:p></o:p></strong></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>CONTRATADA<o:p></o:p></strong></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:10.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:10.1pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:13.0pt;line-height:94%\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;line-height:94%;font-family:\r\n\" calibri=\"\" light\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"calibri=\"\" light\";mso-bidi-font-family:=\"\" arial\"=\"\">________________________________________ <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:13.0pt;line-height:94%\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n10.0pt;line-height:94%\">STE SISTEMAS</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;line-height:\r\n94%\">.<o:p></o:p></span></strong></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.95pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>TESTEMUNHAS<o:p></o:p></strong></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:14.55pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt\">________________________________________<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:.05pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Nome:<o:p></o:p></strong></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:.05pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-font-family:arial\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:333.15pt;text-align:justify;mso-line-height-alt:\r\n0pt\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>CPF:<o:p></o:p></strong></p>',1),(3,'2024-07-28','VENDA AVISTA','<h4 style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times; font-size: 14pt;\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14pt;\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">GARANTIA</span></span>&nbsp;</h4><h4 style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\"><p class=\"translated-text\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times;\"=\"\" style=\"color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; font-size: 14pt;\"></span></p></h4><h4 style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" data-mce-style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times;\"=\"\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 8pt;\" style=\"font-size: 8pt;\">GARANTIA DO PRODUTO</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 8pt;\" style=\"font-size: 8pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1(UM) ANO</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" data-mce-style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times;\"=\"\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 8pt;\" style=\"font-size: 8pt;\">GARANTIA &nbsp;DO SERVIÇO</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 8pt;\" style=\"font-size: 8pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;90(NOVENTA)DIAS</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" data-mce-style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times;\"=\"\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 8pt;\" style=\"font-size: 8pt;\">A GARANTIA DE SERVIÇO cobre peças defeituosas, substituindo-as gratuitamente ficando o cliente isento do pagamento da visita técnica corretiva caso necessário, durante os primeiros 90 (noventa) dias da data de instalação ou no caso de chamadas indevidas onde a visita será cobrada, mesmo antes de findar os 90 dias.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" data-mce-style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times;\"=\"\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 8pt;\" style=\"font-size: 8pt;\">O cliente podera solicitar um&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">CONTRATO DE MANUTENÇÂO&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;ficando assim isento do pagamento de taxas de serviço ou peças de reposição durante o primeiro ano.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" data-mce-style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times;\"=\"\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 8pt;\" style=\"font-size: 8pt;\">A&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">STE Automação e Sistemas</span>&nbsp;se isenta de quaisquer responsabilidades, por situações que fogem ao&nbsp;</span><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 8pt;\" style=\"font-size: 8pt;\">Controle,&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">tais como danos causados por fenômenos da natureza (raios, enchentes, ventos, etc.), ou&nbsp; Ainda danos decorrentes de&nbsp;</span>interferências externas tais como quedas de voltagem, obras da Cia. de&nbsp; Eletricidade, Cia. de Águas, esgotos e colisões.</span></span></p></h4><h4 style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\"><p class=\"translated-text\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times;\"=\"\" style=\"color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">PRAZO DE ENTREGA</span></span><span times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times;\"=\"\" style=\"color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 17.5px;\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 8pt;\" style=\"font-size: 8pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><br></p></h4><h4 style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0.0001pt;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" data-mce-style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;\">DO PRODUTO<span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp; 5(CINCO )DIAS UTEIS APÓ FECHAMENTO DO PEDIDO</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" data-mce-style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;\" style=\"margin: 0px