E SAIDA OU CONTROLE REMOTO.</p><p>O SISTEMA DE CONTROLE DE ACESSO SERÁ IMPLEMANTADO NA NUVEM E CONTARÁ COM UM APLICATIVO PARA CADASTRO, PODENDO TEMBEM SER ACESSADO VIA URL DE QUALQUER COMPUTADOR QUE ACESSE INTERNETE.</p><p>OBS.: NA VERSÃO PRO DO DISPOSITIVO O MESMO CONTA COM A TECNOLOGIA DE INTERFONIA VOIP, ONDE O VISITANTE PODERÁ FALAR DIRETAMENTE COM UMA PESSOA QUE PODERÁ ABRIR O PORTÃO VIA COMANDO NA CONVERSA.</p>','',NULL,0.00,10.00,6363.00,'porcento',2203,1,NULL,1,0,NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,'','Avulso','Externo','',NULL,0),(506,'2025-01-07 09:23:39','2025-01-21 09:22:00','2025-01-21 09:22:00','','A Sair | Aguard Conclusão',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'<p>MANUTEÇÃO&nbsp; PREVENTIVA MENSAL</p>','',NULL,0.00,0.00,0.00,NULL,1912,1,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','Contrato','Externo','',NULL,0),(507,'2025-01-07 13:19:45','2025-01-07 13:18:00','2025-01-07 13:18:00','','Faturado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'<p>VERIFICAR INTERFONE DA PORTARIA.</p>','',NULL,0.00,0.00,0.00,NULL,2137,1,NULL,0,1,NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,'','Avulso','Externo','',NULL,0),(508,'2025-01-08 07:59:59','2025-01-08 07:59:00','2025-01-08 07:59:00','','A Sair | Aguard Conclusão',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'<p>MANUTEÇÃO PREVENTIVA</p>','',NULL,0.00,0.00,0.00,NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','Contrato','Externo','',NULL,0),(509,'2025-01-08 08:16:54','2025-01-08 08:15:00','2025-01-08 08:15:00','','Faturado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'<p>TROCA DA COROA INTERNA</p>','',NULL,0.00,0.00,0.00,NULL,2194,1,NULL,0,1,NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,'','Avulso','Externo','',NULL,0),(510,'2025-01-08 08:23:34','2025-01-08 08:22:00','2025-01-08 08:22:00','','Orçamento',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'<p>VERIFICAR PORTA AUTOMATICA</p>','',NULL,0.00,0.00,0.00,NULL,1925,1,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','Avulso','Externo','',NULL,0),(511,'2025-01-08 09:08:29','2025-01-08 09:07:00','2025-01-08 09:07:00','','Faturado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'<p>VERIFICAR PORTÃO E INTERFONE</p>','',NULL,0.00,10.00,243.00,'porcen